    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάργᾰν-ον</span></b> , τό,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάργω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>band for swathing infants</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				151
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				306
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				1.38
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <i>swaddling-clothes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				237
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἔτ᾽ ὢν ἐν σπαργάνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					755
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				529
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				759
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1606
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς σπάργανά μ᾽ αὐτὸς ἔθηκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					314.6
				</span></i>
			 (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ
				πρώτων ς</span>. <i>ab incunabulis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.41
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῆς γεννήσεως εὐτελῆ
			ς</span>. a mean <i>origin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				7.1.2
			</span></i>:—hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Trag. and Com., <i>objects left with an exposed
				child, the marks by which a person's true birth and family are
				identified</i> (Lat. <i>crepundia, monumenta</i>), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1035
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Donat.
			</span></i> ad Ter.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eun.</u>
				753
			</span></i>; so prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτου</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Τηλέφου</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> δὸς . . μοι τὰ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a plant,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκιμοειδές</span>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπαργάνιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.28
			</span></i>.</div>
